  "body": [
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "Candrasūtra",
      "segment_number": 1,
      "translated_text": "<s>Candrasūtra</s> (Discourse on the Moon)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "1. evaṃ mayā śrutam ekasama",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "yaṃ bhagavāñ",
          "segment_number": 3,
          "translated_text": "the Blessed One"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "śrāvastyāṃ viharati jet",
          "segment_number": 4,
          "translated_text": "was dwelling in <s>Śrāvastī</s>, in <s>Jet</s>-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "a",
          "segment_number": 5,
          "translated_text": "-a-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "v",
          "segment_number": 6,
          "translated_text": "-v-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "a",
          "segment_number": 7,
          "translated_text": "-a-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "n",
          "segment_number": 8,
          "translated_text": "-n-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "a",
          "segment_number": 9,
          "translated_text": "-a"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "anāthapiṇḍad",
          "segment_number": 10,
          "translated_text": "(<s>Jetavana</s>), in <s>Anāthapiṇḍad</s>-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ā",
          "segment_number": 11,
          "translated_text": "-ā-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "r",
          "segment_number": 12,
          "translated_text": "-r-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ā",
          "segment_number": 13,
          "translated_text": "-ā-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "m",
          "segment_number": 14,
          "translated_text": "-m-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "e /",
          "segment_number": 15,
          "translated_text": "-e (<s>Anāthapiṇḍadārāma</s>, the garden of <s>Anāthapiṇḍada</s>)."
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "2. tena khalu samayena rāhuṇā asurendreṇa sarvaṃ candramaṇḍalam āvṛtam*",
          "segment_number": 16,
          "translated_text": "2. At that time, by <s>Rāhu</s>, the lord of <s>asura</s>s, the entire disc of the moon was covered."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "/",
          "segment_number": 17,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "3.",
          "segment_number": 18,
          "translated_text": "3."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "atha",
          "segment_number": 19,
          "translated_text": "Then"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "yā devatā tasmiṃ",
          "segment_number": 20,
          "translated_text": "the deity who dwelt in that"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ś",
          "segment_number": 21,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "candramaṇḍala adhyuṣitā sā bhītā trast",
          "segment_number": 22,
          "translated_text": "moon-disc, she, frightened, terri-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ā",
          "segment_number": 23,
          "translated_text": "-fied,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "saṃvignā āhṛṣṭaromakūpā yena bhagavāṃs teno",
          "segment_number": 24,
          "translated_text": "anxious, with hair standing on end, approached the Blessed One."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "pajagāma /",
          "segment_number": 25,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "upetya bha",
          "segment_number": 26,
          "translated_text": "Having approached, [she bowed at] the Bles-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ga",
          "segment_number": 27,
          "translated_text": "-sed"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "v",
          "segment_number": 28,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "a",
          "segment_number": 29,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "tpādau śirasā",
          "segment_number": 30,
          "translated_text": "One's feet with her head,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "vanditvaikāṃ",
          "segment_number": 31,
          "translated_text": "and having paid homage, stood to one side."
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "te 'sthād ekāntasthitā sā devatā tasyāṃ velāyāṃ gāthā babhāṣe //",
          "segment_number": 32,
          "translated_text": "Standing to one side, that deity at that time spoke these verses:"
        }
      ],
      "segment_number": 2,
      "translated_text": "1. Thus have I heard. At one time"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "blue"
          },
          "text": "Ed. bhitā but MS reads bhītā",
          "segment_number": 33,
          "translated_text": "[Ed. note: bhitā but MS reads bhītā]"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "4.\nbuddhavīra namas te 'stu vipramuktāya sarvataḥ\nsaṃbādhapratipannāsmi tasya me śaraṇaṃ bhava :",
          "segment_number": 34,
          "translated_text": "4. Homage to you, O hero among <s>Buddha</s>s, who are liberated from all! I have entered into distress; be my refuge."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "blue"
          },
          "text": "Ed. buddha vīra",
          "segment_number": 35,
          "translated_text": "[Ed. note: buddha vīra]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "5.",
          "segment_number": 36,
          "translated_text": "5."
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "arhantaṃ sugataṃ loke candramāḥ śaraṇaṃ gataḥ",
          "segment_number": 37,
          "translated_text": "The moon has gone for refuge to the <s>Arhat</s>, the <s>Sugata</s> (Well-gone One) in the world."
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "rāhoś candramasaṃ muñca buddhā lokānukampakāḥ //",
          "segment_number": 38,
          "translated_text": "O <s>Rāhu</s>, release the moon! The <s>Buddha</s>s are compassionate toward the world."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "6. bhagavān āha //",
      "segment_number": 39,
      "translated_text": "6. The Blessed One said:"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "tamonudaṃ taṃ nabhasi prabhākaraṃ virocanaṃ śukla",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "v",
          "segment_number": 41,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "iśuddhavarcasam*\nrāho ś",
          "segment_number": 42,
          "translated_text": "luster — O <s>Rāhu</s>,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "a",
          "segment_number": 43,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "śāṅkaṃ grasa māntarīkṣe praj",
          "segment_number": 44,
          "translated_text": "do not devour the hare-marked one (<s>śaśāṅka</s>, the moon) in the atmosphere!"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ā",
          "segment_number": 45,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "pr",
          "segment_number": 46,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "a",
          "segment_number": 47,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "dīpaṃ drutam utsṛjainam* //",
          "segment_number": 48,
          "translated_text": "Release quickly this lamp of the people (<s>prajāpradīpa</s>)!"
        }
      ],
      "segment_number": 40,
      "translated_text": "That dispeller of darkness, that light-maker in the sky, the brilliant one of pure white"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "7. atha rāhuṇā as",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "u",
          "segment_number": 50,
          "translated_text": "-u-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "rendreṇa tvaritatvaritaṃ candramaṇḍalam utsṛṣṭam* ⟨/⟩\ntataḥ sa",
          "segment_number": 51,
          "translated_text": "-ras, the disc of the moon was hastily released. Then, hurrying, that <s>Rāhu</s> released the moon,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ṃ",
          "segment_number": 52,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "tvaramāṇo 'sau rāhuś candram avāsṛ",
          "segment_number": 53,
          "translated_text": "his body covered in sweat, dis-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "jat*",
          "segment_number": 54,
          "translated_text": "-tressed,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "saṃsvinnagātro vya",
          "segment_number": 55,
          "translated_text": "bewildered,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "thitaḥ saṃbhr",
          "segment_number": 56,
          "translated_text": "agitated, like one"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ānta āturo ya",
          "segment_number": 57,
          "translated_text": "confused and af-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "thā //",
          "segment_number": 58,
          "translated_text": "-flicted."
        }
      ],
      "segment_number": 49,
      "translated_text": "7. Then by <s>Rāhu</s>, the lord of <s>as</s>-"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "8. adrākṣīd baḍir vairocano",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "rāhuṇā",
          "segment_number": 60,
          "translated_text": "by <s>Rāhu</s>,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "asurendreṇa tvaritatvaritaṃ candr",
          "segment_number": 61,
          "translated_text": "the lord of <s>asura</s>s, the disc of the moon"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "a",
          "segment_number": 62,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "maṇḍala",
          "segment_number": 63,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "m utsṛṣṭam* / dṛṣṭvā ca baḍi",
          "segment_number": 64,
          "translated_text": "was hastily released. And having seen, <s>Baḍi</s>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "r gāthāṃ babhāṣe //",
          "segment_number": 65,
          "translated_text": "spoke a verse:"
        }
      ],
      "segment_number": 59,
      "translated_text": "8. <s>Baḍi Vairocana</s> saw [that]"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "9.\nki",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ṃ",
          "segment_number": 67,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "nu sa",
          "segment_number": 68,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "ṃ",
          "segment_number": 69,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "tv",
          "segment_number": 70,
          "translated_text": ", hurrying,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "aramāṇas",
          "segment_number": 71,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "tv",
          "segment_number": 72,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "aṃ",
          "segment_number": 73,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "rāhuś candraṃ vimuñcasi ·\nsaṃsvinnagātro vyathitaḥ saṃ",
          "segment_number": 74,
          "translated_text": "O <s>Rāhu</s>, do you release the moon? With sweat-covered body, distressed, con-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "bhrānta āturo yathā",
          "segment_number": 75,
          "translated_text": "-fused, as if afflicted?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "//",
          "segment_number": 76,
          "translated_text": ""
        }
      ],
      "segment_number": 66,
      "translated_text": "9. Why"
    },
    {
      "tag": "l",
      "attributes": {
        "rend": "blue"
      },
      "text": "Cf. Pelliot Sanskrit bleu 449 Ac: /// ro yathā //",
      "segment_number": 77,
      "translated_text": "[Cf. Pelliot Sanskrit bleu 449 Ac: /// ro yathā //]"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "10.",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "rāhur avocat* //",
          "segment_number": 79,
          "translated_text": "<s>Rāhu</s> said:"
        }
      ],
      "segment_number": 78,
      "translated_text": "10."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "sa",
          "segment_number": 80,
          "translated_text": "My head would split"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "ptadhā me sphalen mūrdhā",
          "segment_number": 81,
          "translated_text": "into seven parts,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "jīvan na sukha",
          "segment_number": 82,
          "translated_text": "and living I would find no happi-"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "m āp",
          "segment_number": 83,
          "translated_text": "-ness,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "nu",
          "segment_number": 84,
          "translated_text": ""
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "yāṃ\nta",
          "segment_number": 85,
          "translated_text": "if,"
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "tra buddh",
          "segment_number": 86,
          "translated_text": "having been addressed by the <s>Buddha</s>'s"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "ābhigītena muñceyaṃ śaśinaṃ na cet*",
          "segment_number": 87,
          "translated_text": "verses, I should not release the moon."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "blue"
          },
          "text": "Cf. Pelliot Sanskrit bleu 449 Ac: rāhu prāha // saptadhā me sphal[e] mūrdhā",
          "segment_number": 88,
          "translated_text": "[Cf. Pelliot Sanskrit bleu 449 Ac: rāhu prāha // saptadhā me sphal[e] mūrdhā]"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "11.",
          "segment_number": 89,
          "translated_text": "11."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "baḍir vairocano 'vocat* /",
          "segment_number": 90,
          "translated_text": "<s>Baḍi Vairocana</s> said:"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "x x x x x - - - x x x x madarśi",
          "segment_number": 91,
          "translated_text": "[lacuna] ... of those who see ..."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "nāṃ\nteṣāṃ gāthābhigītena rāhuś candraṃ vimuñcati //",
          "segment_number": 92,
          "translated_text": "By the power of their verse-recitation, <s>Rāhu</s> releases the moon."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "blue"
          },
          "text": "Cf. Pelliot Sanskrit bleu 449 Ad: + + + + + .. .. .. .. .. .. .. (bh)i(g)itena muñce",
          "segment_number": 93,
          "translated_text": "[Cf. Pelliot Sanskrit bleu 449 Ad: + + + + + .. .. .. .. .. .. .. (bh)i(g)itena muñce]"
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": "12.",
          "segment_number": 94,
          "translated_text": "12."
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "it"
          },
          "text": "candrasūtraṃ samāptam* //",
          "segment_number": 95,
          "translated_text": "The <s>Candrasūtra</s> (Discourse on the Moon) is completed."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}